* **`lv_succ`**: the level-`k` claim gives the level-`k+1` claim (node: `sImpl_node`, then the
  transport `Fin m × Fin (m^k) ≃ Fin (m^(k+1))`), with the scale / width / cost recursions.
* **`lv_all`**: `Lv` holds at every level with the constants `Eb`, `DWb`, `Whb`, `cb`.
