    {P K D S r p w Z : ℕ} {lamp : ℝ} (h : Hyp14 c P K D S r p w Z lamp) :
    ∀ E, LvH c Isym tbl jL rowC K r (Zl c P K D S r w) (3 * Z) (w + EwH c D)
