Under `Hyp14` and the level claims of `lvAllH`, `Hyp14.midPre` gives `MidPre` for the chain
values `chV c (cWc c) P K D S r w` (with `Zr = 3 Z`), and `Hyp14.hGm` the small-value bound
`G + m ≤ N` used by the core stage.
